licence. Each changed file carries a "Modified by the QUICraft project" note.)

QUICraft patch for Netty netty-4.2.19.Final (commit 64cc10f38ea5f5bd7eae48507817c66680d0afdc):
expose quiche's Config::set_enable_relaxed_loss_threshold.

- QuicCodecBuilder.relaxedLossThreshold(boolean): new builder option, unset by default (quiche's
  default, false). Throws UnsupportedOperationException if the native has no binding for it.
- Quic.isRelaxedLossThresholdSupported(): probes the loaded native once, so callers can decide
  before they touch the builder. Patched classes with an upstream native return false.
- JNI: Quiche.quiche_config_set_enable_relaxed_loss_threshold, bound in netty_quic_quiche.c to
  the C function that natives/patches/quiche/0001-ffi-relaxed-loss-threshold.patch adds.

Applied by natives/build-netty-quic.sh with `git apply`, which ignores this text.

